Waterfox source and modifications

BashKitten retains Waterfox-derived browser features through WildBuzzard.
Waterfox source: https://github.com/BrowserWorks/waterfox
Recorded Waterfox donor revision: 8ae6e039a06bcff8173cb4a4c0262beb21f81286
The exact retained ports and their revisions are recorded in
browser/bashkitten/upstreams.toml and browser/bashkitten/ports.toml.

