2.0 notices and copyrights. The full MPL 2.0 and inherited third-party license
inventory are available offline in about:license. Other components retain
their individual license terms; this notice does not relicense them.

Modified by the WildBuzzard and BashKitten projects. BashKitten's changes include
product branding, a single-window browser, a protected Agent view, native local
and remote Agent integration, and ordinary-tab browser controls. The retained
Waterfox work includes browser privacy, private-tab and content-blocking ports;
the source records identify which changes are present in this build.

